# Accepted-risk CVEs for the CD pipeline's Trivy scan (.github/workflows/cd.yml).
# Empty by default — this pipeline has never run against a real image build,
# so there is nothing here yet to justify ignoring. Add entries only after a
# real CI run surfaces a CVE that's genuinely not exploitable in this app's
# context, one per line, with a reason and a recheck date so entries don't
# silently go stale:
#
# CVE-2024-XXXXX exp:2026-06-01
# # Reason: <why this doesn't apply here — e.g. unused code path, patched
# # upstream with no release yet, mitigated by network policy>
